            "en": [
              "The store is open (unless otherwise stated) :\r\n?from October to June :\r\nfriday to Sunday from 11:00 am to 1:00 pm & from 2:30 pm to 6:00 pm.\r\nAnd from July to September :\r\ntuesday to Sunday from 11:00 am to 1:00 pm & from 2:30 pm to 7:00 pm.\r\nOutside these hours, the store is also open on request or by appointment."
